# Big folders and the files of many subfolders load without freezing the window.
open $T
watch-stalls
open $T/flat
wait-count 15000
# Even the list-view paint of 15k rows runs close to the limit on win32 GTK plus
# Defender: under 1500 ms when the scenario runs alone, measured up to 1.7 s when
# the suite runs it back to back — the twin budget holds what was measured here.
!unix expect-max-stall 1500
!win expect-max-stall 3000
action win.view-mode icons
open $T/tree
status-button subfolders
wait-count 15150
# Icon view measures every one of the 15k rows on the UI thread: ~0.8 s under the
# Linux runners, ~4.7 s under win32 GTK plus Defender — same operation, slower paint.
!unix expect-max-stall 1500
!win expect-max-stall 12000
